   "prompt": "The two maps below show a village in 1990 and the same village in 2020. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
   "dataDesc": "Dữ kiện bản đồ: 1990 - làng nhỏ: một đường chính, cửa hàng nhỏ, trường học, cánh đồng lớn phía đông, rừng phía bắc. 2020 - đường chính mở rộng, siêu thị thay cửa hàng nhỏ, trường học giữ nguyên và mở rộng thêm, cánh đồng phía đông thành khu nhà ở mới, rừng phía bắc bị chặt một phần để làm bãi đỗ xe, thêm một phòng khám gần trung tâm.",
   "model": "The two maps show how a village developed between 1990 and 2020.\n\nOverall, the village underwent considerable development over the period. While the school remained in place, farmland and forest were partly replaced by housing and new facilities, and the main road was expanded.\n\nIn 1990, the village was relatively small. A single main road ran through its centre, with a small shop and a school nearby. To the east lay extensive farmland, while the north of the village was covered by forest.\n\nBy 2020, significant changes had taken place. The main road had been widened, and the small shop had been replaced by a large supermarket. The eastern farmland had been converted into a new housing estate. In the north, part of the forest had been cleared to make way for a car park, although some woodland remained. One notable addition was a health clinic near the centre, and the school had been extended, suggesting that the village's population had grown.",
